   "title": "Find a root",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Write the cubic with the missing term,}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{then try x = 3:}\\\\[5pt]&f(x)=3x^3-5x^2+0x-36\\\\[5pt]&f(3)=81-45-36=0\\\\[5pt]&\\text{So x $-$ 3 is a factor.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
